== Block presence ==
project contains its note: True
project contains a grandchild: True
project contains an unrelated block: False
reading a block that was never stored: None
membership test against a missing root: MemoryNotFound
updating a block that was never stored: MemoryNotFound
writing under a missing parent: MemoryNotFound
linking to a block that was never stored: MemoryNotFound
after deletion the note is absent, not an error
